  "title": "Mississippi Mud Cake",
  "description": "This Mississipi mud cake recipe is a favorite with all who try it! A layer of marshmallow cream under the icing is an unusual but excellent addition.",
  "authors": [
    "Carol"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-05-25T19:17:55-04:00",
